sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend as Trails Frontend
    participant Keycloak
    participant Service as Trails Service
    participant API as REST Adapter
    participant App as Application Service
    participant DB as Database Adapter
    participant MySQL

    User->>Frontend: Open secured workflow
    Frontend->>Keycloak: Obtain or refresh token
    Keycloak-->>Frontend: JWT
    Frontend->>Service: API request with bearer token
    Service->>Service: Validate JWT and map roles
    Service->>API: Route request to controller
    API->>App: Call use case service
    App->>DB: Load or store Trails data
    DB->>MySQL: Query/update relational data
    MySQL-->>DB: Result
    DB-->>App: Domain model/result
    App-->>API: Use case result
    API-->>Frontend: REST/HATEOAS response
    Frontend-->>User: Update UI
